: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; 라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">관람시간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: 10:00 ~ 19:00</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ※ </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">매주 수요일 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">문화가 있는 날</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">’ 20:00</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">까지 연장 운영</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; 마</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">휴 관 일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">매주 월요일</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5; margin-left: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;※ </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">광복절 대체공휴일 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">8. 17.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" st